# F2.4 part 2: a split-phase utility service behind its transformer impedance (R + jωL), headless and in
# the game (the D6 cross-runtime golden for the series-inductance phasors). Test leads from L1 to N and
# from L1 to L2 are near-bolted faults through test leads, not loads (P2 has no AC load model yet: a
# lead is its own small resistance at 60 Hz), so L1, L2 and the neutral carry different fault currents
# at different angles. Since F3.6 part 2 an 18 AWG lead carrying kiloamps fuses when its conductor
# reaches copper's melting point (the L1–L2 lead at about 11 ms, the L1–N lead at about 41 ms), so the
# scenario stops at 10 ms, with both faults still on.
#   pnpm sim run apps/sim-cli/scenarios/mains.console --world content/levels/workshop.json
entity.place --ref.id utility.larkmoor-split-phase-25kva --ref.version 1 --positionMm.x 900 --positionMm.y -300 --positionMm.z 200
lead.connect --ref.id lead.quillfern-test-1m --ref.version 1 --a.entity 1 --a.terminal l1 --b.entity 1 --b.terminal n
lead.connect --ref.id lead.quillfern-test-1m --ref.version 1 --a.entity 1 --a.terminal l1 --b.entity 1 --b.terminal l2
sim.step 10
world.hash
